# Route: guide 8 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Gnome (1451
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.1 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 25 to 28, 53
# quests, 3.7 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Ashenvale, Stonetalon Mountains): Lake Falathim -> The Shrine of
# Aessina -> Lake Falathim -> Maestra's Post -> Lake Falathim -> Astranaar ->
# Fire Scar Shrine -> Lake Falathim -> The Zoram Strand -> Astranaar ->
# Mystral Lake -> Night Run -> Satyrnaar -> ….
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Blackfathom Villainy (1200), Vyletongue Corruption (7041),
# Corruption of Earth and Seed (7065).

